      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就在这时，我在训练赛道上看见了一名赛马娘。她似乎\n还没出道，但跑起来相当抢眼。然而更引人注目的是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "780b9133328043a1d9eb13f8bbb77378557d4f3480fff0c39238f8d653662a4d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
